# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else,
# including secrets (.env, functions/local.settings.json, copilot/*.local.*), the venv,
# tests and docs, never reaches the Docker daemon, and new files stay out by default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src
!data
!prompts
!eval

# build leftovers inside the allowed folders
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
